{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12158","headline":"同严逸人东溪泛舟 · 钱起","name":"同严逸人东溪泛舟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"子陵江海心，高迹此闲放。\n渔舟在溪水，曾是敦夙尚。\n朝霁收云物，垂纶独清旷。\n寒花古岸傍，唳鹤晴沙上。\n纷吾好贞逸，不远来相访。\n已接方外游，仍陪郢中唱。\n欢言尽佳酌，高兴延秋望。\n日暮浩歌还，红霞乱青嶂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12158.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12158","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}